eight=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913260/extras/58066fe28764e208dec577c605bd7aa8.webm?t=1715012059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913260/extras/58066fe28764e208dec577c605bd7aa8.mp4?t=1715012059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Exploring the Secret Realm<br>Random exploration of the secret realm can bring some random experiences, both good and bad, and the difficulty will increase layer by layer. At this point, it is necessary to make good use of one's own material resources and enhance the blessings during exploration.<br><br>It's quite interesting to have a good showdown with your own level opponents in the desert arena.<br><br>Double Demon Kings and Three Demon Kings Challenge, increasing the challenge of the game. There are other challenges and so on, waiting for you to discover.",
